      <comment>warnfile  Adding: es</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Sanaag''' is a region in northern [[Somalia]], formerly part of the [[British Somaliland]] protectorate. Its capital is [[Ceerigaabo]], and it is bordered by the Somalian regions of [[Woqooyi Galbeed]], [[Togdheer]], [[Sool]] and [[Bari]], and the [[Gulf of Aden]].

[[Sanaag]] is claimed by the two self-proclaimed, but internationally unrecognized, states of [[Somaliland]] (of which it would form the largest region) and [[Puntland]].

==External links==
* [http://www.somali-info.com/site/?q=node/84 The Surad Mountain Forests in Somalia]
* [http://gallery.somali-info.com/daalo/ Sanaag Photo Gallery]
* [http://www.somali-info.com/site/multimedia/daallo.htm Video of Daallo mountains]
* [http://www.gibbonsstampmonthly.com/Journals/GSM/Gibbons_Stamp_Monthly/July_2005/attachments/jlsomaliland.pdf The Birth of the Somaliland Protectorate's own Postage Stamps]

{{Somalia_Regions}}

{{AfricaE-geo-stub}}

[[es:Sanaag]]
[[nl:Sanaag]]</text>
