      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Sool''' is a region (''gobolka'') in northern [[Somalia]], and was part of the [[British Somaliland Protectorate]]. Its capital is [[Laascaanood]]. It is bordered by Ethiopia and the Somali regions of [[Togdheer]], [[Sanaag]], [[Bari]] and [[Nugaal]].

Sool is claimed by the two self-proclaimed, but internationally unrecognized, states of [[Somaliland]] and [[Puntland]]. Along with Sanaag, Sool has been a source of dispute between Somaliland and Puntland. Sool is the only region in Somalia the civil war did not affect substantially.

{{AfricaE-geo-stub}}
{{Somalia_Regions}}

====See also====
*[[SOL]] (online expression)

[[es:Sool]]
