      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:SomaliaBanaadir.PNG|right|200px|]]

'''Banaadir''' (from ''Bandari'', a port or a harbour; derived from ''Banaderi'', refering to the northern ports of Barawa and Mogadishu) is a region (''gobolka'') in southern [[Somalia]]. The regional capital is [[Mogadishu]], though the region itself is coextensive with the city. It is bordered by the Somalian regions of [[Shabeellaha Dhexe]] and [[Shabeellaha Hoose]] and the [[Indian Ocean]].

{{Somalia_Regions}}

{{AfricaE-geo-stub}}

