      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Bay''' is a region (''gobolka'') in southern [[Somalia]]. Its capital is [[Baydhabo]]. It is bordered by the Somalian regions of [[Bakool]], [[Hiiraan]], [[Shabeellaha Hoose]], [[Jubbada Dhexe]] and [[Gedo]].
Bay region is one of the most populated regions of Somalia and consists of the following districts:
*Baidoa (its capital)
*Bur Hakaba
*Diinsoor
*Qasahdhere
*Ufurow
and the proposed districts of:
*Berdale
*Doynunay

Baidoa used to be the capital of the old Upper Juba region which consists of todays Bay, Gedo, Bakool and most parts of Middle Juba (Jubbada Dhexe).Present regions were created in the 1980's by the then military regime.



{{Somalia_Regions}}

