      <comment>Robot: Changing category Lists of sportspersons</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">The term '''footballer''' is ambiguous, as there are several games known as [[Football games |football]]. The word is not used in [[American English]]; the terms ''football player'' and ''soccer player'' are used instead.

For the lists of noted footballers in the various games of football, see:
*[[List of footballers (soccer)]]
*[[List of American football players ]] 
*[[List of Canadian football players ]] 
