      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''Eurovision Song Contest 1991''' was the 36th [[Eurovision Song Contest]] and was held on [[May 4]], [[1991]] in [[Rome]]. The presenters were [[Gigliola Cinquetti]] and [[Toto Cutugno]].  [[Carola Häggkvist|Carola]] was the winner of this Eurovision with the song, [[Fångad Av En Stormvind]]. 

