      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''Eurovision Song Contest 1989''' was the 34th [[Eurovision Song Contest]] and was held on [[May 6]], [[1989]] in [[Lausanne]], [[Switzerland]]. The presenters were [[Lolita Morena]] and [[Jacques Deshenaux]]. [[Riva (music group)|Riva]] was the winner of this Eurovision with the song, [[Rock Me]]. 

